  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="translation" n="urn:cts:latinLit:phi0474.phi055.perseus-eng1" xml:lang="eng">
        <div type="textpart" subtype="book" n="1">
          <milestone unit="chapter" n="1"/>
          <p><milestone unit="section" n="1"/>My dear son Marcus, you have now been studying a full year under Cratippus.
          <milestone unit="section" n="2"/>He took counsel, as he says, of virtue.</p>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="book" n="2">
          <p><milestone unit="section" n="1"/>Why say more? Arms and the man I sing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
